11450.098200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uSD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"228e9ed9-4fe8-4048-8c5d-2b58e6f31edd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"一旦無効化されると、手動で戻さない限りいくら push しても復活しない","ts":"1621011303.097400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3owZo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f59bf10-03f3-470b-bf64-02909c847800","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"いや、リポジトリにアクティビティがあるうちは、自動無効化自体が走らないんですよ","ts":"1621011283.097000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Vo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1b51cf20-7c91-4c59-88ba-7e1e883e46b7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"workflow 内で何かコミット＆push すれば…","ts":"1621011236.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EX4t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1474D3DB-8982-40F4-A141-4CFF2222E3F4","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"私の gvim-transparency は毎回コミットも走るから無効化されないのかな","ts":"1621011145.095800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fabc521f-31f4-4f36-a4fd-f63fe4ebbde9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"GHA の schedule 機能、2 ヶ月くらい放置しておくと workflow が無効になるけど、この状態で push すると workflow の trigger に push があったとしても走ってくれない。手動で有効にし直す必要がある。\nこれはさすがにバグだと信じたい…。workflow を手動で無効化していた場合は正しいのだけど、手動で無効にしたのか自動で無効になったのかくらい区別してほしい。そして自動の時に schedule 以外で kick されたら再有効化してほしい…","ts":"1621010006.095100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C=z"}]}]
